{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-03-10 10:31:00', 'title': "KANTARO BIOSCIENCES NAMED TO FAST COMPANY'S ANNUAL LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST INNOVATIVE COMPANIES FOR 2021 AND RANKED FIRST IN THE JOINT VENTURES CATEGORY", 'text': "NEW YORK, MARCH 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KANTARO BIOSCIENCES, LLC, A JOINT VENTURE BETWEEN THE MOUNT SINAI HEALTH SYSTEM AND RENALYTIXAI (LSE: RENX / NASDAQ: RNLX), ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO FAST COMPANY'S PRESTIGIOUS ANNUAL LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST INNOVATIVE COMPANIES FOR 2021 AND RANKED FIRST IN THE JOINT VENTURES CATEGORY. KANTARO LAUNCHED IN MAY 2020 IN RESPONSE TO THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC TO MAKE A HIGH-PERFORMING SARS-COV-2 IGG ANTIBODY TEST CREATED AT MOUNT SINAI BROADLY ACCESSIBLE WORLDWIDE."}